sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Sender
  participant L as Link emulator
  participant R as Receiver
  S->>L: SYN (file name, size, protocol, N, m)
  L->>R: SYN
  Note over R: LISTEN → SYN_RCVD
  R-->>S: SYN-ACK (rwnd)
  S->>R: ACK
  Note over R: ESTABLISHED
  loop until every segment is ACKed
    S->>L: DATA seq = i mod 2^m (CRC-32)
    alt delivered intact
      L->>R: DATA
      R-->>S: ACK (cumulative ack, selective seq, rwnd)
    else lost or bit error
      L--xR: dropped / fails CRC
      Note over S: timeout or 3 duplicate ACKs → retransmit
    end
  end
  S->>R: FIN (SHA-256 of file)
  Note over R: verify hash, save file
  R-->>S: FIN-ACK (ok / corrupt)
  Note over R: TIME_WAIT → CLOSED
